s\"</a>.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-02-14T16:57:45.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"Karneades/awesome-malware-persistence","categoryHTML":"<h2>Collection</h2><h3>General</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Cugu/awesome-forensics\">Awesome Forensics</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/Cugu/awesome-forensics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">2k</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":1969,\"repo\":\"Cugu/awesome-forensics\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - Use the tools from this list which includes awesome free (mostly open source) forensic analysis tools and resources. They help collecting the persistence mechanisms at scale, e.g. by using remote forensics tools.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-02-14T16:57:45.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"Karneades/awesome-malware-persistence","categoryHTML":"<h2>Collection</h2><h3>General</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://osquery.readthedocs.io\">osquery</a> - Query persistence mechanisms on clients.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-02-14T16:57:45.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"Karneades/awesome-malware-persistence","categoryHTML":"<h2>Collection</h2><h3>General</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ossec/ossec-hids\">OSSEC</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/ossec/ossec-hids\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span sty